  "name": "Smart Field Device Definition",
  "description": "The smart field device definition function code implements ABB FSK smart transmitters, smart positioners, and other smart field devices with defined specifications. The controller verifies the configuration of the field device at startup. Three specifications can be modified while the controller is in execute mode. In execute mode, the controller gets and monitors the value of the process variable defined in this function code.",
  "description_lines": [
    "The smart field device definition function code implements",
    "ABB FSK smart transmitters, smart positioners, and other",
    "smart field devices with defined specifications. The controller",
    "verifies the configuration of the field device at startup. Three",
    "specifications can be modified while the controller is in execute",
    "mode. In execute mode, the controller gets and monitors the",
    "value of the process variable defined in this function code."
  ],
